# Styling + a11y

- Tailwind first; SCSS modules for complex cases; keep idiomatic property
  order (`stylelint-config-idiomatic-order`). Lint with `yarn lint:css`.
- WCAG 2.1 AA: headings in order with names, labeled controls,
  `aria-current` on breadcrumbs, live regions for search results,
  accessible names on sliders and carousel regions.
- Sanitize every `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` via `@/utils/sanitize`.
